{"id":"43b2728e68e05836","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-skolemization.md","title":"Skolemization","display":"df-skolemization — Skolemization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-skolemization","aliases":["57-df-skolemization"],"display":"df-skolemization — Skolemization","depends_on":["[[57-df-prenex]]","[[57-df-skolem-function]]","[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","[[57-df-simultaneous-substitution]]","[[57-df-skolem-normal-form]]","[[57-df-existential-variable]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-universal-closure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-skolemization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-skolemization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolemization — Skolemization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" href=\"?note=c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" title=\"57-df-prenex\">57-df-prenex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4284b81e17c97cd2\" href=\"?note=4284b81e17c97cd2\" title=\"57-df-skolem-function\">57-df-skolem-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f1bcc0d6bb86201\" href=\"?note=4f1bcc0d6bb86201\" title=\"57-df-simultaneous-substitution\">57-df-simultaneous-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a9a7faa02ecae403\" href=\"?note=a9a7faa02ecae403\" title=\"57-df-skolem-normal-form\">57-df-skolem-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b1739a7dc0b811d9\" href=\"?note=b1739a7dc0b811d9\" title=\"57-df-existential-variable\">57-df-existential-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle,\\psi)\">\\(\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle,\\psi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_n\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\)</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。这是本算子的输入域，前缀取直到无量词矩阵的完整前缀，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" href=\"?note=c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" title=\"57-df-prenex\">57-df-prenex</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\">\\(\\vec z\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 按固定变量枚举的递增列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y_i=\\langle x_j:1\\le j&lt;i\\land Q_j=\\forall\\rangle\">\\(\\vec y_i=\\langle x_j:1\\le j&lt;i\\land Q_j=\\forall\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y=\\langle x_j:1\\le j\\le n\\land Q_j=\\forall\\rangle\">\\(\\vec y=\\langle x_j:1\\le j\\le n\\land Q_j=\\forall\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec e=\\langle i:1\\le i\\le n\\land Q_i=\\exists\\rangle\">\\(\\vec e=\\langle i:1\\le i\\le n\\land Q_i=\\exists\\rangle\\)</span>，各列按指标递增。原自由变量视为显式参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对每个输入及每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\">\\(i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\)</span>，固定互异的新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\varphi,i}\\notin S\">\\(F_{\\varphi,i}\\notin S\\)</span>，元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i=|\\vec z|+|\\vec y_i|\">\\(r_i=|\\vec z|+|\\vec y_i|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i=0\">\\(r_i=0\\)</span> 时为常量。此整个符号选择族是算法环境参数。同时代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4f1bcc0d6bb86201\" href=\"?note=4f1bcc0d6bb86201\" title=\"57-df-simultaneous-substitution\">57-df-simultaneous-substitution</a>，有限全称前缀见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{All}(\\vec y,\\psi)\">\\(\\mathrm{All}(\\vec y,\\psi)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a> 的有限全称前缀函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExVar}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExVar}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b1739a7dc0b811d9\" href=\"?note=b1739a7dc0b811d9\" title=\"57-df-existential-variable\">57-df-existential-variable</a> 的存在量化变量集函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sk}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sk}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是下式定义的 Skolem 化公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\">\\(\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\">\\(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\)</span> 使用同一固定新符号族。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq S\\cup\\{F_{\\varphi,i}:i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\{F_{\\varphi,i}:i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\land r_i=0\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\cup\\{F_{\\varphi,i}:i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\land r_i=k\\}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nt_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}F_{\\varphi,i},&amp;r_i=0,\\\\F_{\\varphi,i}(\\vec z,\\vec y_i),&amp;r_i\\ge1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{All}(\\vec y,\\psi[t_{e_1}/x_{e_1},\\ldots,t_{e_p}/x_{e_p}])\\quad(p=|\\vec e|),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sk}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ExVar}(\\varphi)=\\{x_i:1\\le i\\le n\\land Q_i=\\exists\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq S\\cup\\{F_{\\varphi,i}:i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\{F_{\\varphi,i}:i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\land r_i=0\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\cup\\{F_{\\varphi,i}:i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)\\land r_i=k\\}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nt_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}F_{\\varphi,i},&amp;r_i=0,\\\\F_{\\varphi,i}(\\vec z,\\vec y_i),&amp;r_i\\ge1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{All}(\\vec y,\\psi[t_{e_1}/x_{e_1},\\ldots,t_{e_p}/x_{e_p}])\\quad(p=|\\vec e|),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sk}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ExVar}(\\varphi)=\\{x_i:1\\le i\\le n\\land Q_i=\\exists\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_0(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Func}_0(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\quad(k\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Func}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S_\\varphi^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\quad(k\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个见证函数只依赖原自由参数与其前方的全称变量；没有省略未定义的“…”参数。矩阵无量词，所用同时代入不发生量词捕获。先对重复绑定变量作改名后才能进入本算子的输入域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-prenex","status":"resolved","id"